        "raw_text": "Client Challenge JavaScript is disabled in your browser. Please enable JavaScript to proceed. A required part of this site couldn’t load. This may be due to a browser\n      extension, network issues, or browser settings. Please check your\n      connection, disable any ad blockers, or try using a different browser.",
